<p>Vessel	     ETA	   Cargo	    Quantity   Origin</p>
<p>Belle		unloading   soya	     22,600     U.S.</p>
<p>				     sorghum	   5,100</p>
<p>Volgobalt 196    arrived     wheat	     2,800     Europe</p>
<p>Ocean Line 2     arrived     rapeseed meal   7,500     Europe</p>
<p>Athos		arrived     fish meal	 1,260     Peru</p>
